                            <img src="sections/usage-steps/mages/usage-steps-recovery-mask-1-mob.webp" alt="1. Prepare" />
                        </picture>
                        <article>
                            <h6>1. Prepare</h6>
                            <p>After Micro-Infusion, apply the mask directly to skin. If using it on its own, start with clean, dry skin.</p>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                        <picture data-index="2">
                            <source media="(min-width:768px)" srcset="sections/usage-steps/mages/usage-steps-recovery-mask-2.webp" />
                            <img src="sections/usage-steps/mages/usage-steps-recovery-mask-2-mob.webp" alt="2. Take the mask out" />
                        </picture>
                        <article>
                            <h6>2. Take the mask out</h6>
                            <p>Carefully unfold the mask and smooth it over your face, aligning the eye and mouth openings.</p>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                        <picture data-index="3">
                            <source media="(min-width:768px)" srcset="sections/usage-steps/mages/usage-steps-recovery-mask-3.webp" />
                            <img src="sections/usage-steps/mages/usage-steps-recovery-mask-3-mob.webp" alt="3. Place mask on face" />
                        </picture>
                        <article>
                            <h6>3. Place mask on face</h6>
                            <p>Leave the mask on for 15-20 minutes while you relax.</p>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                    <div class="swiper-slide">
                        <picture data-index="4">
                            <source media="(min-width:768px)" srcset="sections/usage-steps/mages/usage-steps-recovery-mask-4.webp" />
                            <img src="sections/usage-steps/mages/usage-steps-recovery-mask-4-mob.webp" alt="4. Do not rinse" />
                        </picture>
                        <article>
                            <h6>4. Do not rinse</h6>
                            <p>Gently remove and discard the mask. Do not rinse. Pat or massage any remaining serum into the skin until absorbed.</p>
                        </article>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="c-swiper-nav">
                    <button class="c-swiper-button-prev"></button>
                    <div class="c-swiper-pagination"></div>
                    <button class="c-swiper-button-next"></button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    {{/usage-steps }}

